<title>FRANCE: GdesEaux in property deal with Que Caisse.</title>
<headline>GdesEaux in property deal with Que Caisse.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Generale des Eaux will put six office buildings in the La Defense area of Paris worth some three billion francs in a joint-venture company with Caisse de Depot et de Placement de Quebec, the Les Echos newspaper said.</p>
<p>Generale's CGIS property unit has a news conference on Wednesday morning.</p>
</text>
